{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes Untold is a cinematic puzzle-adventure set in a world fractured by time.</strong> <br>Play as a lone traveler navigating strange environments, guided only by echoes of distant sounds\u2014 each with its own history, agenda, and truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness a unique time-slowing ability to solve dynamic platforming puzzles, uncover hidden paths, and reveal the secrets of a world that remembers everything you've done \u2014 and everything you haven't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based puzzles</strong> that challenge your logic and creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Third-person exploration</strong>, cinematic moments, and surreal traversal mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portals of traversals,</strong>\u00a0different portal shapes, different outcomes\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/fe85069be963481aa05c3b6aed839800.poster.avif?t=1762187062\" width=738 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/fe85069be963481aa05c3b6aed839800.webm?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/fe85069be963481aa05c3b6aed839800.mp4?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leap into the unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the double-jump unlocked, vertical puzzles shift \u2014 it\u2019s no longer about where you land, but when you commit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/682b6378b23197621df27cb516c1d8c6.poster.avif?t=1762187062\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/682b6378b23197621df27cb516c1d8c6.webm?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/682b6378b23197621df27cb516c1d8c6.mp4?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal of traversals + double-jump unlocked, verticality becomes a part of the overview.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e86506b3959c08a334e4f2af05f879f0.poster.avif?t=1762187062\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e86506b3959c08a334e4f2af05f879f0.webm?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e86506b3959c08a334e4f2af05f879f0.mp4?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ledge Catch After Jump</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some paths don't lead forward. They fall beneath you.</strong><br>Mastering ledge grabs turns a near-miss into a save.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e7502f138f92934be6558ff8b96d5a61.poster.avif?t=1762187062\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e7502f138f92934be6558ff8b96d5a61.webm?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/e7502f138f92934be6558ff8b96d5a61.mp4?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blast Foes That Try to Slow you down</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They are are a part of this world,</strong><br>Ever present, waiting for you to make an appearance.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/c0acf7d5b179ab0df88ccb0c131d2666.poster.avif?t=1762187062\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/c0acf7d5b179ab0df88ccb0c131d2666.webm?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/c0acf7d5b179ab0df88ccb0c131d2666.mp4?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Environmental Button Activation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One step changes everything.</strong><br>Shifting the terrain itself \u2014 opening new paths, revealing truths, or collapsing the familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/d34ab2f7204ef92470a9b68d473ce31a.poster.avif?t=1762187062\" width=786 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/d34ab2f7204ef92470a9b68d473ce31a.webm?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/d34ab2f7204ef92470a9b68d473ce31a.mp4?t=1762187062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story About Time, Perspective, and Identity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of Echo is a question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if your greatest strength was the ability to pause time \u2014 not to escape, but to listen? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/d2726066ca6c011df361f92e490b5ca6.avif?t=1762187062\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras_big/d2726066ca6c011df361f92e490b5ca6.webp?t=1762187062 width=1560 height=626 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822650?t=1762187062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/95b84bd0325fe482d3f3ce8d9229977734b749f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762187062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/c6608da05c190249d41db555e14ba710cd838329/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762187062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/c6608da05c190249d41db555e14ba710cd838329/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762187062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains no explicit sexual content, violence, or disturbing imagery. It features emotionally reflective and philosophical dialogue, but nothing considered mature or graphic."},"demos":[{"appid":4101810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes Untold is a cinematic puzzle-adventure set in a world fractured by time.</st